        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6a3f7e6f-aafb-4434-aef9-ed2740d3f217\",\"review_text\":\"Honestly love it Im not against paying for the membership\"},{\"review_id\":\"46f72989-2d9d-4017-990c-8dad98d282b1\",\"review_text\":\"spotify have too much songs and all songs are free if you go to the youtube music if you want to hear something you need to pay money\"},{\"review_id\":\"02038999-799c-4988-803b-ffc2c6eae959\",\"review_text\":\"Just the best music streaming app. They should, however, pay the artists more. The platform wouldn't exist without them.\"},{\"review_id\":\"090f9cdc-1ff9-4d7e-aa1c-d6b146615f3d\",\"review_text\":\"Its *WAS* the best app.. I'm not satisfied with the new update.. As a user from about 2 or more years. These updates are forcing me to uninstall this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"53a8eadd-6dd0-4c4d-938f-2c9a9c67ef67\",\"review_text\":\"None\"},{\"review_id\":\"3d897818-60cc-4c64-bab2-c9f8b50de441\",\"review_text\":\"☺️\"},{\"review_id\":\"fe9d47a1-fd4f-4487-a96e-8ac3cd95d477\",\"review_text\":\"Why did it changed? When i first installed spotify i can just clicked on the song that i want to listen but when i updated it, i cant click on the song that i want to listen to...please change it ASAP so i can just listen to the song that i wanted to...🙏🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"65064236-19a5-451f-b420-abb4a44bfe3f\",\"review_text\":\"They keep removing features. I'm done with this trash app lmao 🤡\"},{\"review_id\":\"0db30d47-4f4d-496a-bb95-180f6d545a69\",\"review_text\":\"It's just awesome and ✨🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"fb89973f-bbcc-4bca-899e-6a87869d35f9\",\"review_text\":\"Boycott of Sweden\"}]}"
